  <releasedate>2026-06-05</releasedate>
  <summary>&lt;p>Fastfetch KDE Splash Screen&lt;br />&lt;br />A clean and modern splash screen for KDE Plasma that uses 'fastfetch' to display system info.&lt;br />&lt;br />FEATURES:&lt;br />- Custom Theme Colors: Choose any color you like.&lt;br />- Layout Options: Logo-only or Full System Info.&lt;br />- Background Settings: Selection of colors or transparency.&lt;br />- Smooth Opening: Beautiful character-revealing animation.&lt;br />&lt;br />MANUAL CONFIGURATION (KDE Store Users):&lt;br />If you installed this via KDE Store, you will see a &amp;quot;Configuration Required&amp;quot; message. &lt;br />You can fix this by:&lt;br />1. Running the &lt;code>install.sh&lt;/code> from the project folder.&lt;br />2. OR manually editing the following file (see lines 10-13):&lt;br />   &lt;code>~/.local/share/plasma/look-and-feel/fastfetch-splash/contents/splash/Splash.qml&lt;/code>&lt;br />   - Set &lt;code>property bool isConfigured: true&lt;/code>&lt;br />   - Change &lt;code>themeColor&lt;/code>, &lt;code>displayMode&lt;/code>, and &lt;code>bgColor&lt;/code> values.&lt;br />&lt;br />GitHub Repository: &lt;a href="https://github.com/herzane52/fastfetch-kde-splash">https://github.com/herzane52/fastfetch-kde-splash&lt;/a>&lt;/p></summary>
  <changelog></changelog>
